    "caseNames": [
      "the text codec writes one JSON tuple per message with short tags and positional fields, parts spliced in",
      "the text codec tags every part with its codec, [0, json] or [1, base64] for a deflated one, so no value is reserved",
      "the text codec refuses a part that is no [codec, payload] pair, or of an unknown codec",
      "the text codec carries a binary link's deflated part over a text hop and back unchanged (a relay between codecs)",
      "the text codec leaves out a hold's absent optional fields at the end, null in the middle",
      "the text codec writes a call's trace carrier last, its payload's fields positional then (null when absent)",
      "the text codec writes a call's old-work flag after its carrier (null when absent), its payload's fields positional then",
      "the text codec leaves the old-work flag's value to the message schema: only true passes",
      "the text codec puts byte segments after the tuple and a newline, their lengths the tuple's last field",
      "the text codec refuses a tuple of the wrong arity and segments without a payload carrying them",
      "the text codec refuses a hold without its address: every hold names one",
      "the text codec refuses a retry without its hop budget, or with one outside 1..16 (audit A5)"
    ]
  },
